%% title: `atm clear`
%% summary: Status mutation without content-row deletion.
%% commentary: This path should mutate only message-status for normal clear or delete operations and leave hard deletion to retention cleanup policy.
%% sets: cli
flowchart TD
    A[atm clear request] --> B[Resolve clear mode]
    B --> C1["SQL 1: scan message_status candidates
filter actionable or history mode
exclude already deleted in normal mode"]
    C1 -->|sql error| E1[Typed MailboxReadFailed]
    C1 -->|no rows| O0[Return zero cleared]
    C1 --> C2["SQL 2: mutate message_status only
set deleted or cleared state
do not delete content rows"]
    C2 -->|sql error| E2[Typed MailboxWriteFailed or MailboxLockTimeout]
    C2 --> O1[Return cleared counts]
    O1 --> N1[Optional cleanup policy later archives or hard-deletes rows]
